could not prove the 3–5s production report. Pivot to production read-only evidence: the later same-trace log timeline closed the cause without mutating data; where `mysql` is absent, do not invent Outbox state beyond trace evidence. [Task 1][Task 2][Task 3]\n- Large Maven output was truncated -> continue via streaming `write_stdin(session_id)` rather than treating a truncated response as the result. [Task 1]\n\n# Task Group: youpu-cloud-platform / yopu-im-core Redis authorization RBatch concurrency risk and reproduction plan\nscope: Assess whether authorization snapshot reads should become concurrent/asynchronous, distinguish supported RBatch evidence from unproven claims, and prepare a safe preproduction reproduction plan.\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=test commit, Redis addresses, and live pool configuration are environment-specific; fail-closed authorization and evidence-tier rules are reusable.\n\n## Task 1: Assess authorization-reader async risk and test-branch Batch evidence\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T05-49-30-zy3T-im_redis_batch_concurrency_risk_assessment_and_plan_doc.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\20\\rollout-2026-08-20T13-49-30-01a01db7-a702-74d2-ac1c-a97173e1b791.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-20T06:13:40+00:00, thread_id=01a01db7-a702-74d2-ac1c-a97173e1b791, success: read-only assessment and documented reproduction plan; no production-code change)\n\n### keywords\n\n- RelationAuthorizationSnapshotReader, RBatch, createBatch, BatchOptions.defaults, executeAsync, CommandDecoder, MessageAckService, fail-closed, FENCE_RETRY_DELAYS_MS, c5dcdcfd\n\n## Task 2: Define preproduction mixed-load reproduction and conditional severity\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T05-49-30-zy3T-im_redis_batch_concurrency_risk_assessment_and_plan_doc.md (cw