alues and breaks geometry checks. [Task 1]\n- If LibreOffice/`soffice` is unavailable, use the skill's structural/a11y/style audits and XML review as a fallback, but explicitly state that render-level, page-by-page visual QA was not performed. [Task 1]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Piping Python through PowerShell with Chinese paths caused `PackageNotFoundError: Package not found at 'C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\Documents\\\\????.docx'` -> set `$OutputEncoding = [System.Text.UTF8Encoding]::new()` before `| & $py -`. [Task 1]\n- PAGE/NUMPAGES fields may lack cached displayed values even though Word recalculates them; add a cached value and apply consistent font to field runs for a more stable initial rendering. [Task 1]\n\n# Task Group: youpu-cloud-platform / IM full-duplex JMeter, capacity acceptance, and reliability repair\nscope: Build and run real-user duplex WebSocket benchmarks, use closed-loop cmd=5/6/27/7 evidence for capacity acceptance, and make narrowly tested IMServiceImpl reliability repairs.\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=JMX and source paths are checkout-specific; host addresses, runtime config, and all latency conclusions are run-specific.\n\n## Task 1: Add configurable full-duplex continuous JMeter script\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-07-30T03-12-44-iX9Z-im_jmeter_duplex_pressure_test_handoff_and_bottleneck.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\07\\30\\rollout-2026-07-30T11-12-44-019fb102-9517-7cc0-87d8-3b853a65e1e7.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-01T07:18:19+00:00, thread_id=019fb102-9517-7cc0-87d8-3b853a65e1e7, partial: configurable JMX and cross-host P0 handoff)\n\n### keywords\n\n- im_single_chat_duplex_continuous.jmx, java.net.http.WebSocket, -Jthreads, -JsendCountPerWindow, -JsendWindowSeconds, cmd=5, cmd=6, cmd=27, cmd=7, MissingPropertyException, DuplexListener\n\n